Typical Landmark Pipeline

A complete landmark-processing workflow can be summarized as:

Input Image
     ↓
Face Detection
     ↓
Bounding Box
     ↓
Landmark Model
     ↓
Facial Keypoints
     ↓
Feature Analysis
     ↓
Application

For example:

Image
  ↓
RetinaFace / SCRFD
  ↓
Face Bounding Box
  ↓
Landmark106 / PIPNet / FaceMesh
  ↓
Facial Landmarks
  ↓
 ┌───────────────┬───────────────┬───────────────┐
 ↓               ↓               ↓
Alignment     Blink Detection   Head Pose
 ↓
Face Recognition

This structure allows the landmark module to serve as a common foundation for face recognition, alignment, facial analysis, eye tracking, head-pose estimation, and other computer-vision applications.
